      "text": [
        "ه عن الوليد بن صبيح فقد رويته عن أبي- رضي اللّه عنه- عن عليّ بن إبراهيم، عن أبيه، عن حمّاد بن عيسى، عن الحسين بن المختار، عن الوليد ابن صبيح‌."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Everything in this book that is narrated from Al-Walid ibn Subayh has been transmitted by me from my father - may Allah (swt) be pleased with him - from Ali ibn Ibrahim, from his father, from Hammad ibn Isa, from Al-Husayn ibn Al-Mukhtar, from Al-Walid ibn Subayh."
        ]
      }
